NON-CLINICAL NOTICE (non-legal, plain-language companion to the MIT license)

This software is a non-clinical, non-medical wellbeing companion. It does not
provide diagnosis, treatment, medication advice, or replacement for
professional care. All reasoning frameworks, metaphors, and suggested
interventions reflect the personal experience and thinking of the author, who
is an AuDHD (ADHD + autism spectrum traits) individual, not a medical or
mental-health professional. None of the ideas herein have been clinically
validated. If you experience persistent distress, severe sleep problems, or
any crisis, contact a qualified healthcare professional or local emergency
services.
